    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Akabakhasi nabasaatsa babwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata inywe abakhasi mwesi murio, muhulilenje abasaatsa beenywe; mbu kata abandi khubo abakhaba nibarahulilanga Likhuwa tsana ta, banyoolwe khulwa injenda yabakhasi babwe aharali likhuwa liosi ta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "olwa balola injenda yeenywe yobweleleeshe, halala noburii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhwisiaha khweenywe khuraba obwisiayi bwelwanyi, obwokhubasa liswi, kata obwokhwifwala ebimili bieitsahaabu, kata obwokhwifwala ebiifwalo ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nebutswa khube imela eyo eyamabiswi eyomumwoyo, mubiifwalo ebirasasikha ta, mbu roho yobuholo nobuholeelefu, eyili yobukusi obunji mumoni tsiaNyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila nindio abakhasi abatakatifu bakhale, abachoomia obunaayi bwabwe khuNyasaye, beesiahanga bario, nibahulilanga abasaatsa babwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shinga Sara olwa yahulilanga Aburahamu, namulanga mbu \"Omwami\". Ne bulaano muli abaana bebe, nimuba nimukholanga amalayi, ikholo niyiramurimukha khulwa eshiriisio shiosi ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rata inywe abasaatsa mwesi murio, mumenyenje nabakhasi beenywe nobuchesi; heelesia owashio weshikhasi oluyali, shinga amaani komubilikwe olwa kaleema khukoko, khandi shinga olwa muli abalaame abalaamilwa halala obukoosia obwo, nibwo obulamu; mana okhusaaya khweenywe shikhuleekalilwa ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhusaalisibwa khulwa obulunjishi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elihelelesia ndielino; mbu mubeetsenje abomwoyo mulala, abeshisa, nimuheelananga nabaana beenywe; mube abetsimbabasi, khandi abaholo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muramurunga omundu yesi obubii khulwa obubii, kata amanyeko khulwa amanyeko, tanebutswa mubasabile ikhabi; okhuba lino niiio elia mwalanjilwa, mbu mulie obulaame, nibwo ikhabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba mbu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali heena oulamukholela libii liosi, nimuba nimuli abalumilifu khukali amalayi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa nimuba nimusaalisibwa khulwa obulunjishi, muba abeikhabi; ne murabariitsanga, kata okhubeeyabeeya ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwahule Kristo mumioyo chieenywe abe ye Omwami. Beetsenje nimwirecheeshe okhwiteetsa khumundu yesi oumureeba khushisina shiobunaayi obuli mwinywe; habula khube nobuholo nende obwongoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mube nende omwoyo omulayi, mbu olwa mufukulungwa, abo abanyekanga injenda yeenywe indayi eyili muKristo bafwimbwe omurwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila Nyasaye naba niyeenya mbu musaalisilibwe amalayi aka mukhola, elo liakhashila okhusaalisilibwa ebikhole ebibii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba Kristo yesi yasaalilila ebionoono lulala, omulunjishi khulwabo ababula obulunjishi, mbu akhuyile khuNyasaye. Yeerelwa mumubili, nebutswa yalamusilibwa muroho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne muyeneyo nimwo omwa yatsiila niyeelwatsila tsiroho etsiali mumbohe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne nibo abali nibakhaya okhuhulila khale, olwa obwisimilisii bwaNyasaye bwalindiilila, mundaalo tsilia tsiaNoa, olwa isafina yali niyishikasibungwa; ne musafina eyo abandu abatuutu, mbu munaane bonyene, bahonilibwa namatsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nako amatsi, eshisina mbu obubatisii, obwa omuyembo okwo nikwo eshifwanani shiabwo, bulaano niko akamuhonia, khulwa obulamushi bwaYesu Kristo; ne obubatisii shibuli obuyinii bwelikhwe liomubili ta, habula nikhwo okhusaaya Nyasaye omwoyo omulayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yesu Kristo oyo ali khumukhono musaatsa kwaNyasaye, ewa yatsia mwikulu; abamalaika nabobunyali nabamaani bosi nibeesibwa hasiwe okhumuhulilanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
